  "title": "A simulation of a mind is not a mind",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "5dab7063-2bb5-4e03-8814-39eae66df10d",
      "text": "A computer simulation of a fire burns nothing and a simulation of a rainstorm wets nothing. A simulation of understanding understands nothing, and confusing simulation with duplication is the same mistake for pain, love, cognition, fires or rainstorms.",
